## Phase 0 — Brief and intake

| Step | Question | Writes to |
| --- | --- | --- |
| 0.1 | **The brief.** In your own words, as long as it needs to be — see the checklist below. {% if project_description %}What was given when the project was generated: "{{ project_description }}"{% endif %} | `AGENTS.md` "What this project is" (a two- or three-sentence summary of it), `.baseline/answers.yaml` `brief` |
| 0.6 | **How to proceed**, asked once the recommendation sheet is complete: `all`, `all except <ids>`, or `review` | `.baseline/answers.yaml` `mode` |

Checklist for the brief. Cover what you know, say "don't know" where you don't, and skip what
does not apply:

- **What and for whom.** What the product does, who uses it, and what it deliberately does not
  do.
- **The first release.** What must be in it.
- **Shape.** What it consists of: a service, a background process, a command-line tool, a
  library, an interface, a batch job. How it is delivered: hosted, installed, published to a
  registry.
- **Team.** How many people, who decides on standards, whether it is a solo project, and how much
  AI agents are expected to do.
- **Stage.** Whether anything is in production yet, and how soon it will be.
- **Data.** Personal data, payment cards, health or other regulated data; where data must live;
  the laws or certifications that apply.
- **Customers.** One organization or many, and whether their data must be isolated from each
  other.
- **Money.** Whether it handles amounts, currencies, balances or bookkeeping.
- **Integrations.** Other systems it calls or that call it, events or webhooks, public interfaces
  others will build on.
- **Expectations.** Availability, scale and performance, and what a failure costs.
- **Already decided.** Technology, hosting, tools, conventions.

| Id | Question | Default | Writes to |
| --- | --- | --- | --- |
| 0.2 | ⚑ Who decides on standards and ADRs (names or handles)? Shown is the value given when the project was generated | {{ owner }} | frontmatter `owner`, ADR `deciders` |
| 0.3 | ⚑ Is anything already in production? | no | `04-adr/README.md` |
| 0.4 | ADR governance mode: `pre-production` (amend in place until first production deploy) or `immutable`? | `pre-production` if 0.3 is no, else `immutable` | `04-adr/README.md` `adr_governance_mode` |
| 0.5 | ⚑ Which components does the product have, and what kind is each (service, daemon, cli, library, ui, batch)? | one `service` | `03-architecture/system.md` `component_kinds` |

